Ab hum Ucred ka redesign random ideas se nahi, ek proper product-design project ki tarah execute karenge.

Main tumhare Ceramic Frosted Glass + Spatial Depth + Apple-inspired UX + Native Android concept ko master blueprint mein refine kar raha hoon. Iska objective sirf beautiful screenshots banana nahi hai. Final app visually premium, functionally complete, responsive aur actual Kotlin + Jetpack Compose native honi chahiye.

