Product vision

An Apple-inspired business finance operating system for Indian merchants, combining the simplicity of a premium consumer app with the capabilities of a professional business ledger.

### 1\. Project principles — non-negotiable

| Principle            | Implementation rule                                   |
| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Native first         | Kotlin + Jetpack Compose, not a WebView wrapper       |
| Apple-inspired       | Borrow design principles, not Apple's exact interface |
| Ceramic material     | Glass used selectively, not on every component        |
| Spatial depth        | Depth communicates hierarchy and interaction          |
| Zero slop            | No unnecessary decoration, pills or random gradients  |
| Financial clarity    | Amounts, dues and transactions always readable        |
| Functional integrity | No existing feature silently removed                  |
| Responsive           | Small Android screens supported                       |
| Accessibility        | Contrast, touch targets and reduced-motion support    |
| Performance          | Smooth rendering without unnecessary blur or overdraw |

Design reference clarification: "iOS 27-inspired" is our creative direction, not a claim that we are reproducing an official iOS 27 design specification.

