Three surface classes:

| Material       | Usage                              | Visual treatment                        |
| -------------- | ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| Ceramic Solid  | Main content, ledger, lists        | Clean solid surface                     |
| Ceramic Frost  | Floating sheets, overlays          | Translucent, restrained blur            |
| Titanium Depth | Wallet deck and signature surfaces | Layered shading and specular highlights |

Material rules:

* Inner highlight should be subtle.

* Border opacity must remain low.

* Shadows should communicate elevation, not decoration.

* Background blur should not make text difficult to read.

* Do not put every list row inside a glass card.

* Avoid excessive transparency over busy backgrounds.

Critical refinement: Blur is expensive on some Android hardware. Use it selectively, with a non-blurred fallback for lower-performance devices.

