| Ledger         | Create, edit and view workflows work               |
| Persistence    | Data survives app restart                          |
| Offline        | Supported local workflows function offline         |
| Security       | No exposed API secrets or unauthorised data access |
| Motion         | No stuck gestures or dead interactions             |
| Performance    | No persistent jank during normal navigation        |
| Accessibility  | Usable contrast and touch targets                  |
| Regression     | Existing features remain available                 |

### 12\. What we must not do

These are explicit anti-patterns for the redesign:

* No random gradients on every screen.

* No excessive blur everywhere.

* No giant floating buttons covering important content.

* No decorative pills around ordinary metadata.

* No fake 3D effects that obscure information.

* No unnecessary animations on financial figures.

* No tiny text to fit more information.

* No inconsistent icon families.

* No replacing real features with visual placeholders.

* No claiming a native conversion when the result is still a WebView.

* No changing financial calculations as part of UI work.

